🔥 THE HUNT IS ON! 🔥

Nitty Gritty Chopper City’s Annual Scavenger Hunt, hosted by @_saharstarr_ of @helluvapartyproductions , is BACK at BORN-FREE TEXAS!

📍 Yellow Rose Canyon
📅 October 15–18

We’re bringing a WEEKEND-LONG scavenger hunt to the grounds — hunt down hidden gems and win some SICK-ASS PRIZES! 🏆🔥

👀 WHAT ARE YOU LOOKING FOR?

We’re not telling you yet. 😈

When you arrive, look for the official Scavenger Hunt posters around the campgrounds. They’ll tell you exactly what you’re hunting for and how to play.

💎 HOW IT WORKS:
Take a photo of the poster, start hunting, and find ONE hidden gem!

Each gem is numbered and matches a prize waiting for you at the Nitty Gritty Chopper City booth.

⚠️ ONE GEM PER PERSON — NO EXCEPTIONS!
