@OffRoadTravelTV is the only weekly program on television devoted to off-road adventure travel and the overland lifestyle. Join them every week as they explore backroads and byways looking for adventure and unique experiences around the globe.

In 2026 they visit Iceland to drive 4x4’s, the Virgin Islands and Hawaii to drive UTV’s, then they rode adventure bikes to the Arctic Circle and much more before they capped off the season with a trip to Bali to drive UTV’s in this jungle paradise. They also tested and evaluated dozens of products throughout the year from off-road trailers to the latest in overland gear and accessories.

Off-Road Travel TV airs every Sunday at 9:30am on the Racer network with re-airs throughout the week. Off-Road Travel TV is also available on most major streaming services and all of their episodes are available on their website at offroadtraveltv.com/video

