☀️ For the first time ever, @robotheartfoundation’s iconic art car ran on 100% solar - charged by SOLAR STATION, Black Rock City’s first megawatt-scale clean energy plant providing free clean electrons to all BRC citizens, 24/7. 

This solar-powered sunrise moment was made possible by a coalition of burners - @robotheartfoundation, @solarpunks.club, Solaris, and @burningman - who fused resources, skillsets and belief to show a new future, today. 

What we prove on playa doesn’t just stay there. This rapid-deploy solar innovation is a model for disaster relief, construction, live music, large gatherings and other applications that currently rely on large diesel generators. 

As our grid becomes increasingly strained, we need more clean energy solutions that can deploy quickly and while supporting community resiliency. 

And, music just sounds better when the power is clean ☀️

