Some moments just stay with you 🖤
@etnica.pleiadians.official at Wild Horses 2024. If you were there, you know. If you weren’t — this is exactly why you can’t miss 2026.

Etnica are one of the true legends of the psychedelic trance world. 
The Ibiza based due have been producing and performing more than 30 years with timeless sounds and anthems that have moved dancefloors across the planet — and still as relevant today as ever, performing on the biggest stages in the world. They recently closed a full day at Ozora and last year at Boom — two of the most iconic psytrance festivals on Earth — and this year they’re bringing that energy to Wild Horses. Expect an extended set 👀🖤

Having them at Wild Horses is a full circle moment for us and one we are so proud of.
