Most of my zines function as personal diaries, though I have also created a couple of fictional titles. Flowery is a diary zine I have produced almost monthly since 2019. Broken Branches and I Love Suzy are narrative, fictional works. Shit Dates features real submissions from readers that I adapt and illustrate.

