Our partnership with Humanitix has not only provided us with a great ticketing platform, service & support when we've needed it, it has paved the way for us to give a little bit back through our ticket sales, which means the absolute world to know some parts of the global community are benefiting on the other side of these sales.

By partnering with Humanitix , we have generated real impact and contributed to donations to highly effective charities in Australia and abroad. Our impact is equivalent to:

-Doubling the income of 16 families living in extreme poverty for at least at year, through GiveDirectly

-Restoring eyesight to 51 people through cataracts surgery through the Fred Hollows Foundation

-Providing one year of quality education to 440 disadvantaged girls in India through Educate Girls

-Protecting 1,584 children from Malaria for a season through the Malaria Consortium

-Creating 10,424 children's books in local languages to empower underprivileged kids to learn in the poorest parts of the world, through Room to Read

-Restoring health, dignity and economic independence to 15 mothers with fistula repairs in African villages, through the Fistula Foundation

