🔔 WE ARE REALLY SORRY 🔔 

Last week we posted an AI recreation of the New Moon Poster to promote our upcoming New Moon Twilight Market. Whilst this was meant to be a tongue in cheek post entirely for laughs, we had some comments on that post pointing out that we should be championing local artists instead of relying on AI to have created the image. And to that we say, you were right! 

We are still learning and we are really sorry that we didn't approach a local artist or creative business to recreate that poster instead. We have deleted it and you won't see any use of AI images from us again. We truly are committed to boosting local creatives and we have tagged all of our amazing artists coming to our New Moon Twilight Market on 16 May. 

Swipe to see their wonderful creations. To everyone that commented, thank you for being so passionate about art and rightfully calling out when businesses need to make a change. 

