The “First Rebirth” is a film by @nachorambla, reflecting on the experience of @burningman and the @temple_of_the_deep by @_miguelarraiz_ and the Temple crew.

The Temple in Black Rock City is a space for reflection, healing, and shared vulnerability. Entering requires care and respect for the desert, for what takes place there, and above all, for what the Temple represents. To honor this environment, photographing or recording others, their personal moments, or their tributes is done with explicit permission only.

This film approaches the Temple experience with sensitivity, observing without intervening, allowing the images and atmosphere to breathe.

The Temple is never the work of one person. It exists because of the hundreds of people who imagine, design, and build it in extremely demanding conditions, and who bring their talent, time, and energy to make it real.

The “First Rebirth” becomes a quiet tribute to that collective effort and to the emotional space the Temple opens each year in Black Rock City.

Thank you to everyone who makes the BRC Temple possible.

